        "description": {
          "en": "Connector to a separately installed and started Windows GUI Runtime. Recommend 0.1.11; 0.1.6 marks the minimum HTTP protocol, not a compatibility range. Check the actual version, authenticated HTTP MCP and review/continue tools. Configure trusted loopback runtime_url and connection_token; bind MCP and Skill to Pi. You deploy and stop Runtime separately. Disabling/uninstalling this connector does not stop/uninstall Runtime or delete its data. External model APIs may charge usage fees.",
